          "output": "Best fix: move your own settings out of the `akka.*` tree, for example to `my-app.*`. The checker's `[typo]` check flags any property under `akka.*` that has no matching `reference.conf` entry.\n\nIf the settings have to stay under `akka.*`, list their paths as confirmed typos:\n\n```hocon\nakka.diagnostics.checker {\n  confirmed-typos = [\"akka.my-app.foo\", \"akka.my-app.bar\"]\n}\n```\n\nI'm assuming this is the Akka Diagnostics Config Checker. I didn't look at your config, so if it's a different checker, tell me which one.\n\nOther checks have their own opt-outs:\n- **Low-level settings you changed on purpose** (`[power-user-settings]`): add them to `confirmed-power-user-settings`.\n- **A single check you've decided to ignore**: add its key to `disabled-checks`, for example `[\"dispatcher-throughput\"]`.\n\nAvoid turning the checker off entirely."
